msgid "Try Minimal or Compact to compare layers with less vertical scrolling. Use Relaxed when you want larger thumbnails. Track Size changes vertical space; timeline zoom changes how much time is visible horizontally. **Thumbnail Style** separately controls how thumbnails are distributed along each clip."
